{"id":"99ddb0c0274d4609","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-prob-martingale-process.md","title":"ZFC Prob Martingale Process","display":"df-zfc-prob-martingale-process — ZFC Prob Martingale Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob-martingale-process","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob-martingale-process"],"display":"df-zfc-prob-martingale-process — ZFC Prob Martingale Process","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob-martingale-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob-martingale-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob-martingale-process — ZFC Prob Martingale Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation\">58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> are imported above</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> is the imported conditional-expectation predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (代表元层可积性谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation\">58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (可测函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbMartingaleProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbMartingaleProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}martingale\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbMartingaleProcess}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal F:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_n,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathcal F_n\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land M:\\omega\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(M_n,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(M_n;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_n),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\exists Y\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,M_{n+1},\\mathcal F_n,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y(\\omega)\\neq M_n(\\omega)\\})=0\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}martingale\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbMartingaleProcess}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal F:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_n,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathcal F_n\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land M:\\omega\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(M_n,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(M_n;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_n),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\exists Y\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,M_{n+1},\\mathcal F_n,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y(\\omega)\\neq M_n(\\omega)\\})=0\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Conditional expectation is quantified through its typed predicate, so the\ndefinition does not depend on an undeclared global choice of representatives.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation","status":"resolved","id":"d139c8e88761c759","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation","status":"resolved","id":"d139c8e88761c759","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (代表元层可积性谓词, see [[58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measurable}_S$ (可测函数谓词, see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbMartingaleProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}martingale\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbMartingaleProcess}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathcal F:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_n,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathcal F_n\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land M:\\omega\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(M_n,\\Omega,\\Sigma,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(M_n;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_n),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\exists Y\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,M_{n+1},\\mathcal F_n,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y(\\omega)\\neq M_n(\\omega)\\})=0\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2085,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-prob-martingale-process.md|58-df-zfc-prob-martingale-process]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca832ed6bc22f728","a740bdad87b97ac6","bbbec05fde1d3b01","d139c8e88761c759"]}